WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 54c871cb5fb9450d2d15334c3f48a372

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.700
Karibu tena. Kwa hiyo sasa unajua jinsi ya

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:05.780
kutumia kauli za masharti if, else, else if kufanya

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:09.260
maamuzi katika msimbo wako. Nikuuliza

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.620
ufungue mlango tu ikiwa mtu

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.420
ana umri zaidi ya miaka 20, pengine utajua

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.080
la kufanya. Lakini vipi ikiwa

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:20.250
unahitaji kuangalia kama mtu ana umri zaidi ya 20

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.790
na amevaa mavazi sahihi? Kwa hiyo unahitaji

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:27.120
kuangalia masharti mawili tofauti kwa wakati mmoja.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.940
Ungefanyaje? Hebu fikiri. Sawa.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.820
Labda unaweza kuwa na kauli ya masharti

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.520
iliyowekwa ndani ya nyingine, kama vitanzi

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:39.680
vilivyowekwa ndani ya vingine hapo awali. Unaweza kusema, ikiwa age

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:43.400
ni kubwa kuliko 20, basi tunaingia katika

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:47.360
kizuizi hiki cha msimbo, kisha if nyingine ikiwa outfit ni sawa na

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:50.660
disco, na mabano mengine ya kukunja na

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:54.380
kizuizi kipya cha msimbo. Hilo litafanya kazi, lakini

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.200
linakuwa chafu sana, hasa unapotaka kuwa na

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:00.350
masharti mengi. Kwa bahati nzuri, kuna njia rahisi zaidi,

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:02.760
nayo ni kuwa na masharti

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:06.130
yenye sehemu nyingi. Badala ya kuangalia

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:08.020
kitu kimoja tu katika sharti, tunaweza kuangalia

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:11.360
vitu viwili au vitatu au zaidi. Na ili

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.000
kufanya hivi, tunahitaji kutumia keyword

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:18.180
and. Sasa, kwa bahati mbaya, katika JavaScript, keyword and

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:20.880
si neno and halisi, kama ilivyo

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:23.480
katika baadhi ya lugha. Badala yake, unatakiwa kuwa na

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:26.800
alama mbili za & karibu karibu. Itabidi

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:29.180
tu ukumbuke hili. Inaudhi, lakini

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:30.640
ndivyo ilivyo, na utaizoea.

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.830
Kwa hiyo tunaweza kutumia hili

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:36.790
kutengeneza sharti lililo tata zaidi. Tunaweza

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:40.080
kusema ikiwa age ni kubwa kuliko 20 na

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:43.280
outfit ni disco, basi tunaendelea.

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:46.440
Ikiwa age ni ndogo kuliko 20 au

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:49.360
outfit si disco, basi kauli nzima,

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:52.360
sharti zima ni sikweli. Kama umewahi

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:55.080
kusoma mantiki, labda umetengeneza vifaa vya kielektroniki au

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:57.560
umefanya hesabu za hali ya juu zaidi, basi hili

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:59.920
litakuwa jambo la kawaida sana kwako. Kama sivyo,

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:02.620
utalifahamu haraka. Tunaweza

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:06.420
pia kutumia or, na tena, kwa bahati mbaya, hakuna

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:09.479
keyword nzuri ya or katika JavaScript. Badala yake,

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:11.340
tunalazimika kutumia mistari hii miwili

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:14.360
iliyo karibu kumaanisha au. Inaonekana ajabu,

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:16.310
lakini kwa kweli sivyo. Utaizoea,

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:19.600
utaizoea tu. Kwa hivyo sasa tunaweza kusema

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:22.740
ikiwa mtu ana zaidi ya miaka 20 au

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:25.440
amevaa mavazi ya disco, basi anaweza kuingia. Kwa hivyo

00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:27.820
tutakuwa na sherehe yenye watoto waliovaa mavazi ya disco

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:31.060
na watu wazima waliovaa vibaya, jambo linaloonekana la maana.

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:34.580
Sasa, kuna jambo moja linalowachanganya watu

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:37.660
kuhusu and na or, nalo ni kwamba

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:41.020
kila upande wa na/au unahitaji

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:44.200
kuwa ulinganisho kamili. Kwa hiyo hata kama

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:47.500
unalinganisha variable hiyo hiyo kwa pande zote mbili,

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:50.400
unatakiwa kuirudia. Hauwezi kuandika if

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:53.560
age is greater than 13 and less than

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:57.310
20. Unatakiwa kuandika if age is

00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:00.840
greater than 13 and age is

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:04.200
less than 20. Unahitaji pande zote mbili ziwe

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:09.040
ulinganisho kamili. Katika mazoezi yanayofuata,

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:12.060
utaendelea kutumia and na or kuchanganya

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:14.720
masharti. Unahitaji kufikiri ni lini masharti

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:17.230
yote mawili yanahusika na ni lini moja tu kati yao

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.790
linahitaji kuwa kweli. Bahati njema, na

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:20.660
tutaonana hapa tena hivi karibuni.
